# Language policy

- **Chat replies to the user: always Arabic**, even if the user writes in English or any other language
- **Documentation** under `docs/` and `plans/`: write in **English**
- **File and folder names**: English only (`plans/`, `status.md`, `wave-01-foundation.md`, …)
- **Code identifiers**: English (Vue/JS). User-facing copy stays in locale JSON (`ar` / `en`)
- Do not create new project paths or documentation filenames in Arabic
